# Brand icon

This page uses the **circular button** (`app_icon.png`) generated from `lumina-web/public/brand/logo.png` — cream face, raised ember rim, transparent outside.

- File: `app_icon.png` (same button as the website nav).
- Do not clip it to a squircle. The PNG is already circular.

To change the illustration, replace `lumina-web/public/brand/logo.png` (cream square) and run `npm run icons` there.
